# The GPD Win 2 profile of the PC board: the build settings for that handheld (variant.yml build_env = these pairs on one line).
# Its 6" panel is a 720x1280 portrait panel (mounted turned in the case): the native-size image shows it 1:1, and the window
# server's S60 mode (360x640 at scale 2, os/board/wsini-native.txt) fills it exactly. Its drivers:
#   storage  the M.2 SATA SSD on the chipset's AHCI controller (xk_ahci.cpp; xk_ata.cpp falls back to it with no IDE master)
#   touch    the Goodix GT9xx on the LPSS DesignWare I2C (xk_i2ctouch.cpp); its coordinates are the panel's, so no rotation
#   input    the built-in keyboard and the gamepad are USB devices on the xHCI controller: USB_HOST=1 (the pheusb layer)
#   power    the power button through ACPI (xk_power.cpp); the battery waits for the board's EC map (its acpidump)
#   drives   os/board/estart.txt as the PC: C: = the SSD's first partition
PHOREPOC_NATIVE=1
SCREEN=720x1280
SCALE=1
USB_HOST=1
